{
  "_comment": [
    "Employer registry for scripts/grad_radar.py — SG/HK graduate & early-career radar.",
    "Each entry maps an employer to its ATS and the tenant identifiers needed to hit that ATS's",
    "public JSON API. One request per employer returns their whole job board, which is why this",
    "beats opening career pages one by one.",
    "",
    "VERIFIED = the endpoint was actually fetched successfully during research (see reviews/).",
    "UNVERIFIED = tenant guessed from an email domain or job URL; the script logs a failure and",
    "moves on, so a wrong guess costs nothing. Fix or delete as you learn.",
    "",
    "To add a Workday employer: open their careers site, the URL is",
    "  https://<host>/<site>/job/...  and host looks like <tenant>.wdN.myworkdayjobs.com",
    "To add Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby/SmartRecruiters: the token is the slug in their board URL."
  ],

